    <briefdescription>
<para>Interface for discovering search forms and parsing result lists. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Two implementations are provided:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1scraper_1_1_html_search_engine" kindref="compound">HtmlSearchEngine</ref> – uses pugixml to analyse real HTML</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1scraper_1_1_in_memory_search_engine" kindref="compound">InMemorySearchEngine</ref> – injects controlled HTML for unit tests </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
